### Consultar todos los sprints
GET http://127.0.0.1:8002/sprints

### Consultar un sprint
GET http://127.0.0.1:8002/sprints/1

### Crear un sprint
POST http://127.0.0.1:8002/sprints
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Sprint de prueba",
    "fecha_inicio": "2026-11-20",
    "fecha_fin": "2026-12-04"
}

### Actualizar un sprint
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8002/sprints/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Sprint actualizado",
    "fecha_inicio": "2026-11-20",
    "fecha_fin": "2026-12-10"
}

### Eliminar un sprint
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8002/sprints/1
